guarantee: AC-2: every message show sets is offered to the Notifier exactly once, outside the session lock (a later message replaces an earlier one before it is offered)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/recording/mod.rs
added_by: test-writer
equivalent: every lock section shows at most one message (one Notify per blocked press, one fail/notice per stop, one job end per worker section), so the outbox never holds two offers at a drain
--- old
        std::mem::take(&mut self.outbox)
--- new
        self.outbox.pop().into_iter().collect()
--- end
